1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,800
(Mrs Wolowitz:)Oh!

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,240
(Mrs Wolowitz:)I had a pastrami
sandwich.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,440
(Mrs Wolowitz:)She had eggplant lasagna.

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,910
(Mrs Wolowitz:)Like that's what a person
orders in a Jewish deli.

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:14,480
(Howard:)Besides food, did you get along?
Did you talk?

6
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:18,110
Oh, sure! Did you know
she's going to school

7
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,580
(Mrs Wolowitz:)to become a
microbiologist?!

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,980
(Howard:)No, she never mentioned it.

9
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:29,220
(Mrs Wolowitz:)I bet she did and
you didn't listen!

10
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,490
(Howard:)Yeah, that's probably it.
So, what do you think?

11
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:34,760
(Howard:)Do you like her?
She's great, huh?

12
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,160
She's a lovely girl!

13
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,870
Cute as a button!

14
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:42,170
(Howard:)That's good to hear,
'cause I've got some news.

15
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:43,740
(Mrs Wolowitz:)I hope it's
good news,

16
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:47,040
(Mrs Wolowitz:)because I've got nothing but
disappointment in here!

17
00:00:55,580 --> 00:01:03,020
(Howard:)Bernadette and I
are getting married.

